Manzara has one retained baseline: 20261008_0062, with no parent revision.
Its frozen SQL includes the durable catalog, workflow checkpoints, views,
functions, triggers, constraints, and pg_trgm dependency. Python metadata is
not a complete schema definition. Future migrations descend from this baseline.

The baseline preserves the deployed revision ID and contains no corpus rows,
operational-state transfers, or historical adapter installers. Bootstrap,
older-database upgrade policy, and recovery are documented in
../docs/operations.md.
